M1 Vout gate 0 0 nch W=94.76u L=0.2u
M2 Vout mirror Vdd Vdd pch W=179.92u L=0.9u
M3 mirror mirror Vdd Vdd pch W=179.92u L=0.9u
Cl Vout 0 940f
Cf Vout gate 424f
Cs gate Vin 940f
Id mirror 0 293µ
V1 Vin 0 PULSE(0 10m 10n 100p 100p 50n 100n) AC 1
V2 Vdd 0 1.8
Vbias N001 0 0.52
Rbias gate N001 10Meg
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS
